{
  "id": "LUK.18",
  "number": "18",
  "bookId": "LUK",
  "reference": "Luka 18",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 43,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Namuji na nkīma nchīlwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbinha lūsumo lo kūbalanga gīkī shiigelile bakomeele ū kūlomba, yaya ū kūgwa ng'holò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūhaya gīkī, “Walīho namuji mu nzengo nebe, walī atang'ogohile Mulungu; na a banhū walī atabadīlīlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ū mu nzengo gwenūyo walīmo na nkīma walī wachīlwa ngoshi; wikalaga ūja būlī gwa ū kūlī namuji okandayīīla alīhaya, ‘Nigunanhage baba nalī na ng'wanishi!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gakabīta makanza atūdīlīlaga, alīyo nose wanoga wiyangūla wei ng'wenekīlī. Wiwīla gīkī, ‘Nūūlū īkī natang'ogohile ū Mulungu, na a banhū natabadīlīlaga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alīyo nahene īkūbeelela nangunanhe ū nchīlwa ng'wenūyū, nguno akūnikoyaga no; īkī nose waninojaga gete!’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, ū Seeba ūhaya, “Ng'wabona ūmo akahayīla ū namuji ng'wenūyo nūūlū īkī walī atī ntūngīlīja? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angū, ū Mulungu hamò na wiyūmīlīja bokwe ū bose ūmo alī ng'wenūmo, atūdūla ū kūbagunanha a basolwa bakwe abo bakanīlīīlaga līīmi na būjikū? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīmuwīla akūbagunanha wangū. Alīyo ūlū ūshoka ū Ng'wana wa Munhū, angū, akūsanga kūlīho ū kūzunya ū mu sī?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Balombi babīlī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama hangī ūbinha lūsumo abo bisanyaga gīkī a boi hū batūngīlīja no, kūnū būbadalaha pye a bangī. Ūbawīla gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Banhū babīlī bakaja mu hekalu kūlomba, ūmò walī Mfalisayo, ūngī ntobisha wa goodi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mfalisayo wīmīīla wandya kūlomba alikumīlīja wei ng'wenekīlī gīkī, ‘Mulungu nalīkūlūmba, nguno natī gīt'ūmo balī a banhū a bangī pye: Banyeecha, bahūnga, bashihani; nūūlū natī gīt'ūmo alī ū ntobisha wa goodi ūyū! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene nakafungaga ng'hangala ibīlī būlī nyuma, na hangī nakafunyaga īmò ya ng'wikūmi ya shikolo shose īsho nakapandīkaga!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū ntobisha wa goodi ū ng'wene wīmīīla ha mhūjo, ūduuma nūūlū kūbūūcha miso gakwe ng'wigūlū. Ūgelela kwiyinamīīla dūhū, ūyitūla tūla ha shikuba kūnū alīhaya gīkī, ‘Mulungu nikūlīlagwe, nalī munhū wa shibi ū nene!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīmuwīla ū ng'wenūyo akaja ī kaya obalīlagwa būtūngīlīja, kūtinda ū ūngī ūyo; nguno būlī ng'wene ūyo wigūngūhya ng'wenekīlī akūdohelejiwa, alīyo ūyo widohya akūgūngūhiwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu na baana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būng'wenhela na baana gīkī abakuumye, gwike a bahemba aho bababona būbahama! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yesu ūbitana bize a halī we; ūhaya gīkī, “Bazunīlījagi a baana bize a halī nene, mutabalemejage; nguno ū būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu būlī wabo a ba mbika yenīyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīmuwīla gwa ng'hana gīkī ūyo atūwanukūla ū būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu gītī ng'wana, atingīla mo na hado yaya!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūlemeelwa kwa ngosha nsabi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna nsugi nebe ūmūja gīkī, “Nangi wawiza, nīīte mhayo kī nabize ng'wingīji ū mu būpanga butashilaga?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūng'wīla, “Nibūlī ūlīnitana wawiza? Atīho wawiza nūūlū ūmò ūlū atī Mulungu wike! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe ūshimanile ī shilagīlo ūmo shihayīlile; ī gīkī, ‘Yaya ū kūshihya, Yaya ū kūbūlaga, Yaya ū kwiba, Yaya ū kūkaanīla būlomolomo, Nkūjage so na noko.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūhaya, “Pyī ī yenīyī nīdimile kūfuma ha būyanda!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yesu aho wigwa gīko ūng'wīla, “Ūlīleba ho mhayo gūmò, shijinjage pyī ī shikolo īsho ūlī nasho ūbinhe bahabī, ūkūbiza na wibīkīja wa sabo ng'wigūlū, hūna wize ūnilondeele.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wigwa ī yenīyo akapīnīhala no, nguno walī nsabi ntaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu ūnkalalīla; hūna ūhaya, “Īlī shilambu no abo balī na sabo ū kwingīla ū mu būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo īlī shinogu ī ngamīla ū kūbīta mu kapūndū ka lūshinge, kūtinda ū nsabi ū kwingīla mu būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo badegelekaga būkumya no, bandya kwibūja gīkī, “Yee! Alīyo lūūlū nani ūyo adūgije ū kūpīla?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūhaya, “Īyo ītadūlīkanile ū kū banhū, īdūlīkanile ū kūlī Mulungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Petelo ūhaya, “Ī gīsī angū ūlībona gīkī a bise twaleka ī shikolo shise kūlwa kūkūlondeela bebe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūbawīla, “Nalīmuwīla gwa ng'hana gīkī, atīho nūūlū ūmò ūyo waleka numba nūūlū nke, nūūlū baana ba ng'wawe, nūūlū babyaji, nūūlū baana bakwe kūlwa nguno ya būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyo atanukūla ng'hangala ningī ū ng'wikanza lya haha īlī, hama ū ng'wikanza īlo līliza būpanga butashilaga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūbawīla hangī ya kūcha na kūjūūka kwakwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbasola abo ikūmi na babīlī, hūna ūbawīla; “Ī haha tūlīlinha kūja Yelusalemu, managi gīkī īkūjūshikīlījiwa pyī īyo yandīkilwe mu bahangi kūlwa Ng'wana wa Munhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno akūtūūlwa mu makono ga banhū ba mahanga bangīmbe nyachilū na kūnsondagūla na kūnswīla mate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūlū būmala kūntūla bakūmūlaga, alīyo akūjūūka ha lūshikū lo kadatū lwaho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike batitegelegije nūūlū gūmò ū mu yenīyo, baalī bataalī babisīlilwe; hama batamūgije na a makūlū gayo īyo akīhaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūpījiwa kwa mboku wa Yeliko",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wegeela ī Yeliko, ūsangwa alīho mboku nebe igashije hihī na nzīla, akwilombelejaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahayigwa ibita lya banhū balībīta, ūbūja ni mhayo kī ū gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būng'wīla, “Yesu wa Nazaleti alībīta.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna wandya kūhamuka alīhaya gīkī, “Yesu Ng'wana wa ng'wa Daūdi, nikūlīlagwe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo baalī kū būtongi būyūng'hama gīkī ahuumūle, alīyo ū wei hū ongeja gete ū kūhamuka; alīhaya, “Ng'wana wa ng'wa Daūdi, ka nikūlīlagwe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu wīmīīla ūlagīla enhwe aho walī; aho wegeela ūmūja, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ūtogilwe nakwītīle mhayo kī?” Nang'hwe ūhaya; “Seeba ka nayūbona nane!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūng'wīla, “Bizagūbona ū kūzunya kwako kwakūpījaga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana haho na haho wandya kūbona, ūnondeela ū Yesu kūnū akūnkumīlījaga Mulungu. Na a banhū abo bakabona būngongoola ū Mulungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
